#!/usr/bin/env python3
# apply_emc_sell.py — fence EMC_SELL_20261012   (requires EMC_CARRY_20261012)
#
# EMC_V1 backtest "Leg action" — VET V1's field — plus an optional protective
# wing. Default BUY = the sealed strategy, unchanged.
#   * SELL: the same spot cross is expressed by SELLING the opposite option —
#     an up cross sells the PE, a down cross sells the CE. Band / pick apply
#     to the sold contract. Trigger: the sold option's own EMA fast BELOW
#     slow (its premium falling). SL sl_pts ABOVE the entry premium, TP
#     tp_pts BELOW (stop on bar highs, target on bar lows, a gap through a
#     level books the open, stop first on a bar touching both). The opposite
#     spot cross buys it back and arms the other side. Trailing stop follows
#     the trough. Short-side charges (STT on the sale). Works with carry.
#   * Hedge wing (SELL only, optional): VET's rule — buy the DEAREST option of
#     the same type & expiry at or under "Wing max ₹" at the short's fill
#     minute (real print first; model-priced fallback with the IC/VET
#     primitives, rows flagged synthetic — can be switched off); no wing →
#     no trade. ONE row per position carrying the pair's P&L (wing symbol /
#     entry / exit on the row); diag hedge_real / hedge_synth /
#     no_hedge_entries / hedge_cost_total / hedge_synth_pnl_gross.
#   * Direction filter now reads "bullish only / bearish only" (the cross).
#   * Trade Replay marks a short's arming cross correctly (a short PE is bullish).
#   * BACKTEST ONLY: paper/live refuse leg_action SELL or a wing.
#
# Proof the BUY path is untouched: 18 configs (incl. carry) re-run before and
# after — trades, summaries and diagnostics identical.
#
#  EDIT  backend/app/backtest/emc/{emc_v1_engine,backtest_emc_runner,test_emc_runner_sim}.py,
#        backend/app/engine/emc/emc_live_core.py            (whole files, sha-guarded)
#        backend/app/backtest/replay/overlays.py            (2 anchored edits)
#        frontend/src/pages/Backtest.jsx · backtest/SweepBuilder.jsx · backtest/paramFormat.js
#  Mirrored to desktop/src-tauri/{backend,frontend}/ when those trees exist.
#  Gates: py_compile, esbuild, EMC backtest suite (159), EMC live suite (35), Trade Replay suite.
#
# Usage: python3 apply_emc_sell.py [--repo PATH] [--allow-dirty] [--skip-tests] [--skip-esbuild]
# Run ONLY this script — it carries every payload itself.

